{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225250","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222525001:0":{"text":"안 돼, 가면 안 돼!","source_cn":"不要，不要过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75D8F89600B78E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222525002:1":{"text":"앞에, 커, 배고파! 엄청난 녀석! 무서워!","source_cn":"前面，很大、很饿、很厉害的家伙！可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45ED7F9345B5398E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222525003:1":{"text":"악마가 앞에 있다는 거군? 제대로 잘 찾아온 것 같네!","source_cn":"所以恶魔就在前面？看来咱们没找错地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E526C4B1AD9C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222525004:1":{"text":"아... 안돼! 가면 안 돼! 먹혀! 한입에! 먹혀!","source_cn":"不——不可以去！会被吃掉！一口！全吃掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F6A7805C77BFF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222525005:1":{"text":"저 작은 녀석들이 이렇게까지 겁을 먹다니. 엄청나게 강한 녀석인가 봐?","source_cn":"哇哦，竟然能把这些小东西吓成这样。那家伙看起来还挺厉害的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09FCCFA530C81D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t